    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019950/extras/3a5556c811ca709045a98ae0b8f15ec8.avif?t=1751234621\" width=600 height=111 /></span>Do you want to create beautiful tiny cities without spending all of your time into resource management? Mini Worlds is for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Mini Worlds, a cozy, relaxing sandbox for you to create whatever you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Generate</strong> beautiful and unique landscapes to play on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build\u00a0</strong>charming, tiny cities for your townsfolk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Decorate</strong>\u00a0for more detail to add that homey feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No goals</strong> or timers, Mini Worlds is all about relaxing and creating your own world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019950/extras/a20741eba14829932f4d023902f8130d.poster.avif?t=1751234621\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019950/extras/a20741eba14829932f4d023902f8130d.webm?t=1751234621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019950/extras/a20741eba14829932f4d023902f8130d.mp4?t=1751234621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How does Mini Worlds work?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the world of your dreams</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start creating beautiful cities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kick back and relax</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019950/extras/628bb1bb694765084858352e7d349ace.poster.avif?t=1751234621\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019950/extras/628bb1bb694765084858352e7d349ace.webm?t=1751234621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019950/extras/628bb1bb694765084858352e7d349ace.mp4?t=1751234621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini Worlds has no real goal, just relax and have fun building. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mini Worlds is inspired by beautiful games like:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Islanders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fabledom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kingdoms and Castles</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019950/extras/3a5556c811ca709045a98ae0b8f15ec8.avif?t=1751234621\" width=600 height=111 /></span>Do you want to create beautiful tiny cities without spending all of your time into resource management? Mini Worlds is for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Mini Worlds, a cozy, relaxing sandbox for you to create whatever you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Generate</strong> beautiful and unique landscapes to play on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build\u00a0</strong>charming, tiny cities for your townsfolk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Decorate</strong>\u00a0for more detail to add that homey feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No goals</strong> or timers, Mini Worlds is all about relaxing and creating your own world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019950/extras/a20741eba14829932f4d023902f8130d.poster.avif?t=1751234621\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019950/extras/a20741eba14829932f4d023902f8130d.webm?t=1751234621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019950/extras/a20741eba14829932f4d023902f8130d.mp4?t=1751234621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How does Mini Worlds work?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the world of your dreams</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start creating beautiful cities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kick back and relax</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019950/extras/628bb1bb694765084858352e7d349ace.poster.avif?t=1751234621\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019950/extras/628bb1bb694765084858352e7d349ace.webm?t=1751234621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019950/extras/628bb1bb694765084858352e7d349ace.mp4?t=1751234621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini Worlds has no real goal, just relax and have fun building. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mini Worlds is inspired by beautiful games like:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Islanders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fabledom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kingdoms and Castles</p></li></ul>",
